{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My Hidden Journey</i> is a cozy hand-drawn hidden object adventure. Explore a charming 2D world full of secrets, uncover treasures tucked into every corner, and journey across three unique themed realms: a medieval fantasy land, timeless classic fairy tales, and the wide open seas dotted with mysterious islands. With three distinct musical soundscapes and interactive objects that bring each scene to life, sharpen your eye and discover the hidden wonders waiting for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautifully hand-drawn 2D scenes across multiple themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074940?t=1759815052","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074940?t=1759815052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074940/c839e20695ee27843dd5c528864aa23a0b0e51e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759815052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074940/c839e20695ee27843dd5c528864aa23a0b0e51e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759815052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My Hidden Journey</i> is a cozy hand-drawn hidden object adventure. Explore a charming 2D world full of secrets, uncover treasures tucked into every corner, and journey across three unique themed realms: a medieval fantasy land, t